hwui's Bitmap.cpp without libbinder's IServiceManager.h (ADR-0043 a1).

Bitmap.cpp includes <binder/IServiceManager.h> outside its Windows side, but uses nothing of it on either side of
__ANDROID__. The header comes with libbinder, which Minato neither has nor fetches: there is no Binder in Minato
(fixed decision 4). Without it, nothing Bitmap.cpp includes brings the <stdlib.h> of its calloc and free, so it
includes that itself.

--- a/frameworks/base/libs/hwui/hwui/Bitmap.cpp
+++ b/frameworks/base/libs/hwui/hwui/Bitmap.cpp
@@ -33,10 +33,7 @@
 
 #include <cutils/ashmem.h>
 #include <log/log.h>
-
-#ifndef _WIN32
-#include <binder/IServiceManager.h>
-#endif
+#include <stdlib.h>
 
 #include <Gainmap.h>
 #include <SkCanvas.h>
